                        Complete Goods Flow
                    </span>


                    <h2>
                        An End-to-End Process
                        Instead of Isolated Solutions.
                    </h2>


                    <p>

                        Every step builds upon the previous one.
                        Your inventory stays fully traceable
                        and your employees work with consistent data.

                    </p>

                </div>


                <div class="workflow-grid">


                    <article class="workflow-step">

                        <span class="step-number">
                            01
                        </span>

                        <div class="step-icon">
                            ↓
                        </div>

                        <h3>
                            Purchasing
                        </h3>

                        <p>

                            Manage suppliers,
                            create purchase orders, and
                            plan required items.

                        </p>

                    </article>


                    <article class="workflow-step">

                        <span class="step-number">
                            02
                        </span>

                        <div class="step-icon">
                            📦
                        </div>

                        <h3>
                            Goods Receipt
                        </h3>

                        <p>

                            Record delivered quantities
                            and assign goods to the correct
                            warehouse or storage location.

                        </p>

                    </article>


                    <article class="workflow-step">

                        <span class="step-number">
                            03
                        </span>

                        <div class="step-icon">
                            ⌖
                        </div>

                        <h3>
                            Storage
                        </h3>

                        <p>

                            Distribute stock to specific locations
                            and know at all times
                            where an item is placed.

                        </p>

                    </article>


                    <article class="workflow-step">

                        <span class="step-number">
                            04
                        </span>

                        <div class="step-icon">
                            ↔
                        </div>

                        <h3>
                            Relocation
                        </h3>

                        <p>

                            Move goods between storage locations
                            or warehouses and document every movement.

                        </p>

                    </article>


                    <article class="workflow-step">

                        <span class="step-number">
                            05
                        </span>

                        <div class="step-icon">
                            ☷
                        </div>

                        <h3>
                            Sales Order
                        </h3>

                        <p>

                            Manage customer orders,
                            verify line items, and check
                            available stock levels.

                        </p>

                    </article>


                    <article class="workflow-step">

                        <span class="step-number">
                            06
                        </span>

                        <div class="step-icon">
                            ↑
                        </div>

                        <h3>
                            Goods Issue
                        </h3>

                        <p>

                            Book out goods in a controlled manner
                            and keep your inventory
                            automatically up to date.

                        </p>

                    </article>

                </div>

            </div>

