                <div class="faq-list">


                    <details open>

                        <summary>
                            Which companies is this solution suitable for?
                        </summary>

                        <p>

                            Warehouse Management is designed for companies with physical warehouses,
                            large item catalogs, or frequent goods movements – including wholesale,
                            building materials trade, spare parts trade, manufacturing, and e-commerce.

                        </p>

                    </details>


                    <details>

                        <summary>
                            Can I manage multiple warehouses?
                        </summary>

                        <p>

                            Yes. Multiple warehouses can be managed separately and organized
                            with their respective storage locations.

                        </p>

                    </details>


                    <details>

                        <summary>
                            Can I manage specific storage bins/locations?
                        </summary>

                        <p>

                            Yes. Storage bins can be created, activated, deactivated,
                            and assigned to specific warehouses.

                        </p>

                    </details>


                    <details>

                        <summary>
                            Can I manage supplier purchase orders?
                        </summary>

                        <p>

                            Yes. Supplier orders, items, quantities, and delivery status
                            can be managed centrally.

                        </p>

                    </details>


                    <details>

                        <summary>
                            Can I manage customer orders?
                        </summary>

                        <p>

                            Yes. Customers and sales orders can be managed and seamlessly connected
                            to inventory processes.

                        </p>

                    </details>


                    <details>

                        <summary>
                            Are stocktaking and inventory reports included?
                        </summary>

                        <p>

                            Yes. The system includes full inventory counting tools, stock level reports,
                            warehouse valuation, goods movement logs, low stock alerts, as well as product and supplier reports.

                        </p>

                    </details>


                    <details>

                        <summary>
                            Can multiple users work in the system simultaneously?
                        </summary>

                        <p>

                            Yes. Users and roles can be managed centrally, and access rights
                            can be granted based on specific job responsibilities.

                        </p>

                    </details>


                    <details>

                        <summary>
                            Can I export data to Excel?
                        </summary>

                        <p>

                            Yes. All relevant lists and reports can be exported to Excel for further processing.

                        </p>

                    </details>

                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


